# Repo-root .dockerignore. Applies ONLY to builds whose context is the repo
# root (`.`) -- currently just api-gateway (compose.yml: context: .). The
# open-webui + markitdown builds use their own context dirs (docker/open-webui/,
# docker/markitdown/) + their own (absent) .dockerignore, so this file does not
# affect them.
#
# Exclude everything, then allow only the api-gateway build inputs: the gateway
# sources + the shared matcher scripts/kb_ignore.py. Keeps the context tiny
# (docker/gateway/ ~350K + one file) instead of sending root/ data/ .backups/ (~10G).
*
!docker/gateway/
!docker/gateway/**
!scripts/kb_ignore.py
# Re-exclude bytecode caches (last match wins over the !docker/gateway/** allow).
**/__pycache__/
**/__pycache__